{# dissent.j2 — ADR-05 dissent rendering partial.
   One steelman per competing frame, four required sub-fields each.
   STUDIO-T-TPL-DISSENT-01: at least 1 competing frame.
   STUDIO-T-TPL-DISSENT-02: steelman + evidence + conditions + confidence.
   Zero competing frames triggers re-run signal (STUDIO-T-TPL-DISSENT-03).
#}
{% macro render_dissent(dissent_frames) %}
{% if dissent_frames | length == 0 %}
<!-- RERUN_SIGNAL: zero competing frames — MAC re-run required -->
*No competing frames available. Analysis requires at least one dissenting position.*
{% else %}
{% for frame in dissent_frames %}
## Competing Frame: {{ frame.frame_name }}

**Steelman (strongest version of this position):**
{{ frame.steelman }}

**Evidence supporting this frame:**
{{ frame.evidence }}

**Conditions under which this frame becomes the recommendation:**
{{ frame.conditions }}

**Confidence relative to recommended frame:**
{{ frame.confidence }}

{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
